# The Avatar stage's protection from each of the controller's opponents: Bot2's Lightning Bolt cannot target it (the refused
# Cast, with a Bolt to Bot1's face as the control), and Bot2's Ornithopter cannot block it on turn 7 though it blocks Bot1's
# Ornithopter, so seven damage goes through. The Scout ability on turn 7 afterwards makes it a 2/3 Kithkin Scout (the later
# effect replaces the Avatar's subtypes and base power and toughness) but the protection, granted by the Avatar ability,
# stays: on turn 8 the second Bolt cannot target it either.

